## Endpoints

### Data Read (5)
- `GET /api/v1/billing/subscription` — Retrieve billing subscription details for the user.
- `GET /api/v1/labels/post` — Fetch post labels for organization and categorization.
- `GET /api/v1/posts/recycle_predictions` — Get predictions for recycling existing posts.
- `GET /api/v1/users/me` — Get the currently authenticated user's profile information.
- `GET /api/v1/workspaces/home_widgets` — Retrieve home widgets configuration for a workspace.

### Data Write (1)
- `POST /widget` — Create a new widget with provided configuration.

### Config (1)
- `GET /api/widget-config/{widget-configId}` — Retrieve configuration details for a specific widget.

### Core API (4)
- `GET /{id}` — Access core API functionality using an ID.
- `GET /{id}/` — Access core API functionality using an ID.
- `GET /api/v1/{v1Id}` — Access core API functionality using a v1 ID.
- `GET /api/v1/{v1Id}/` — Access core API functionality using a v1 ID.

